# Title: PowerShell Script Change Permission Via Set-Acl
# ID: bdeb2cff-af74-4094-8426-724dc937f20a
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-10-18
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects PowerShell execution to set the ACL of a file or a folder
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_exec="*Set-Acl *" AND process_exec="*-AclObject *" AND process_exec="*-Path *")) AND (((process_name="PowerShell.EXE" OR process_name="pwsh.dll")) OR ((process_path="*\\powershell.exe" OR process_path="*\\pwsh.exe"))))
